		{"id":"a32674f5e33833d2","type":"text","text":"\n|     | What to do    | Description                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|     | Gods/stars    | have a basic setup and have ideas why they were also bad and it was better to go shatter a planet, irrevocably change a solar system kill almost everyone and cast remaining civilization into darkness |\n|     | Pithia System | have a basic set up for the original Pithia system and what what was in there                                                                                                                           |\n|     |               | Figure out the composition and behavior of the current system and how it affects life on Ephyrea                                                                                                        |\n| X   |               | Diagram for days of the week                                                                                                                                                                            |\n|     | Rift travel   | Diagrams for travel between continents                                                                                                                                                                  |\n|     |               | Overview of different sections in travel proces                                                                                                                                                         |\n|     |               | Overview of rift vehicles                                                                                    